~ start
do DialogueHandler.one()
You're Agent Fifteen, a secret spy working for the United Nations. (press e to continue)
do DialogueHandler.two()
You have a mission...find three pieces of incriminating evidence against Alex Miller, a notorious international illegal arms dealer.
do DialogueHandler.three()
Your team located his apartment and all you have to do is look for good evidence. [wait=0.5] BUT...you realize that he comes home in 4 minutes.
do DialogueHandler.four()
The United Nations gifted you the power to rewind time. So before Miller catches you, if needed, make sure to rewind.
do DialogueHandler.five()
You only have 2 rewinds.
do DialogueHandler.six()
Each time you rewind, Miller comes home faster and is catching onto the fact that you're rewinding time.
do DialogueHandler.seven()
Use e to interact with items in his apartment.
do DialogueHandler.eight()
Hold r to rewind time.
do DialogueHandler.nine()
AND MAKE SURE YOU LOOK AT EVERYTHING [wave]CLOSELY[/wave]. ANYTHING YOU FIND...it'll help.
do DialogueHandler.ten()
Best of luck, Fifteen.
=> END

~ end_this
=> END!